WEBVTT

00:00.680 --> 00:04.440
With my meager virtue I have reigned for 27 years.

00:04.760 --> 00:10.160
Worries accumulated in my heart, working diligently without rest fearing I would fail the ancestral foundation.

00:11.560 --> 00:16.760
Now the realm is settled the divine land recovered I am gravely ill.

00:17.040 --> 00:22.200
And cannot rise this is the natural way of life and death unavoidable for all people, past and present.

00:22.280 --> 00:23.840
You need not lament.

00:24.640 --> 00:30.133
Marquis of Yongning Xie Xuan pillar of the state, loyalty shines like sun and moon.

00:30.280 --> 00:33.947
In the future, he may be the first among your advisors.

00:34.480 --> 00:40.320
The succession has found the right person the ancestral temple and people have someone to rely on though I depart this world.

00:41.000 --> 00:43.320
What regrets do I have?

